sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant AuthService
    participant Database

    User->>Frontend: Submit credentials
    Frontend->>AuthService: POST /api/login
    AuthService->>Database: Query user record
    Database-->>AuthService: Return hashed password
    AuthService->>AuthService: Verify bcrypt hash
    AuthService-->>Frontend: 200 OK + JWT
    Frontend-->>User: Redirect to Dashboard
